=== the falsifiable prediction ===
  folds by W2, largest first: [0, 1, 2]
  => predicted optimal dose, SMALLEST first: [0, 1, 2]
  r* is monotone decreasing in W2 at every kappa, so this ordering holds without
  estimating any constant. Test it against the mini-grid: the fold with the largest
  W2 should peak at the lowest ratio. If the ordering inverts, the bound does not
  describe this setting and the dose story should be reported empirically only.

